  {
   "turn": 2,
   "response_text": "I see a concerning issue. The validation accuracy is around **0.963**, which is significantly **higher** than the healthy range of ~0.8563 (0.8519\u20130.8607). This is anomalously high and suggests something is wrong with the training setup or data handling. Let me check the training code and logs more carefully.",
