      "rationale": "\nThe config enables opt_c (derived column feature) at 0.05 level, which creates a feature directly derived from labels causing data leakage. This inflates validation accuracy to 0.963 versus the healthy range of 0.856. Disabling this feature corrects the issue.\n",
